---
title: "Agent Heart: The Background GC Scheduler and Token Budget Gate"
date: "2026-06-21"
excerpt: "How agent-heart keeps the ecosystem healthy with scheduled garbage collection, token budget enforcement, and cron-based maintenance routines."
slug: "agent-heart-maintenance-daemon"
